    "Id": "vehicledef_CHEVALIER_BAP",
    "Name": "Chevalier (BAP)",
    "Details": "The Chevalier Light Tank was produced by and for the Star League. The Succession Wars devastated the stores of the Chevalier as the Successor States often cannibalized them for parts. Only Millennium Industries of Terra continued to produce the design, and that was snapped up by ComStar. This variant that is popular with the Explorer Corps removes armor to mount additional components. It adds a Beagle Active Probe and a Machine Gun.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 6/9 hexes / 180/270 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100     20\n<b>Left</b>          65     20\n<b>Right</b>        65     20\n<b>Rear</b>         50     20\n<b>Turret</b>       80     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      360    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color>",
    "Icon": "Chevalier"
  },
